@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced

title Figure 1836. Transfer mode register (TRANSFERMODE)

map "TRANSFERMODE (Offset: 0x000C, Access: Read/Write)" as REG {
  15 => XFERMODE_DMAENABLE
  14 => XFERMODE_BLKCNTENA
  13 => (reserved)
  12 => XFERMODE_AUTOCMDENA
  11 => XFERMODE_DATAXFERDIR
  10 => XFERMODE_MULTIBLKSEL
  9 => 0
  8 => 0
  7 => 0
  6 => 0
  5 => 0
  4 => 0
  3 => 0
  2 => 0
  1 => 0
  0 => 0
}

note bottom of REG
  R (Read):  All bits readable
  W (Write): Bits 10-15 writable
  Reset:     0x0000 (all bits = 0)
end note

@enduml